2. Runtime library: PDFium (not stored in this repository)

   Deimos Reader loads PDFium dynamically at run time (pdfium.dll on Windows,
   libpdfium.so on Linux) through the pdfium-render crate. The library is not
   part of this repository (*.dll and *.so are ignored by git). The copy shipped
   in the v0.6 Beta release archives is byte-identical (SHA-256
   ae913f407e8d3f5cdbf08a9869564d647b13e132e01eb376c0a5a33b7a227a45) to
   bin/pdfium.dll of pdfium-binaries release "chromium/8100", pdfium-win-x64
   (PDFium 157.0.8100.0), https://github.com/bblanchon/pdfium-binaries.

