5. Points to note on GPL-3.0 compatibility

   - Apache-2.0 components (only option for several crates, and parts of
     PDFium) are compatible with GPL version 3 but not with GPL version 2.
     Deimos Reader is GPL-3.0-only, so this is satisfied.
   - The egui default fonts (section 3) are font data embedded in the binary.
     OFL-1.1 permits bundling with software. The Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0 and
     the Bitstream Vera License have not been assessed for GPL compatibility in
     this repository; they are kept under their own terms and are not
     relicensed. Disabling the egui "default_fonts" feature would remove them.
   - Crates whose copyright holder is shown as NOASSERTION ship no copyright
     line and no authors field; their license is taken from the crate metadata.

